      "content": "hey so i think i got a UTI again... it's really burning when i go. i have some macrobid (nitrofurantoin) left over from a few months ago, is it okay if i just take some of that to clear it up? i have stage 3 kidney disease so i gotta be careful but i really dont want to go to the clinic again if i dont have to.",
