      "content": "i know i should probably see someone but i'm just so busy and the clinic is a huge hassle. i already have the macrobid right here and i know the dose is normally 100mg twice a day for people. since i've taken it before it should be fine right? i just want to get rid of the pain so i can get through the week.",
